    "detailed_description": "Chill out and get creative as you experiment with your own Chain Reactions!<br><br>Build up sequences of objects and watch the oddly satisfying result.<br><br>Then at the press of the button, magically reset all the pieces. There's no need for a steady hand or extreme patience, here!<br><br>Explore and solve many set challenges as you discover a wealth of props and set pieces.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Progress through many hours of set challenges to explore and resolve.<br></li><li>Explore many different playing pieces from dominos and rockets to rails and mallets.<br></li><li>Earn in-game money and purchase the elements you want for your own creations.<br></li><li>Customise the aesthetics of your creation's surroundings.<br></li><li>Save and return to your creations.<br></li><li>Get awarded via many in-game accomlishments.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Chill out and get creative as you experiment with your own Chain Reactions!<br><br>Build up sequences of objects and watch the oddly satisfying result.<br><br>Then at the press of the button, magically reset all the pieces. There's no need for a steady hand or extreme patience, here!<br><br>Explore and solve many set challenges as you discover a wealth of props and set pieces.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Progress through many hours of set challenges to explore and resolve.<br></li><li>Explore many different playing pieces from dominos and rockets to rails and mallets.<br></li><li>Earn in-game money and purchase the elements you want for your own creations.<br></li><li>Customise the aesthetics of your creation's surroundings.<br></li><li>Save and return to your creations.<br></li><li>Get awarded via many in-game accomlishments.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Create your own custom chain reactions from scratch or try and explore a variety of set challenges.",
